\f0\fs24 \cf0 pipeline requirements\
every time the pipeline is ran all output it creates should meet these standards\
\
consistent pool of information to pull from, syllabus, simple study guides\
every exam question should have a model H1 answer, writable by a student, within the amount of time given for each question\
every relevant diagram to the question should be screenshotted and visible next to each question \
flashcards should cover all examinable knowledge within a chapter \
there should be no duplicate flashcards between chapters\
every exam question should contain labels with: the year it was asked, how many marks its worth, how long the question should take, whether the question was on the higher or lower level paper, the chapter it belongs to, the type of question, usually categorised by marks eg: short response, essay question,\
the exam information section should also be filled in from the syllabus specifications document \
every flashcard should have a question adeptly prompting the information contained, e.g What was catholic emancipation?, what is mitosis?, who was rosa parks?\
